---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { BRAND_CONSTANTS } from '@digikhojindia/shared';
---

<Layout
  title={`Annual Maintenance Contract (AMC) Policy | ${BRAND_CONSTANTS.COMPANY_NAME}`}
  description="Transparent terms governing Digikhojindia's Lifetime Free AMC proposition and enterprise maintenance agreements."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400">Policy & Terms</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mt-2">
        Annual Maintenance Contract (AMC) Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
        Effective Date: November 2026 • Official Representative: {BRAND_CONSTANTS.OWNER_NAME}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 space-y-8 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Core Marketing Statement -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-500/30">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">
          Marketing Proposition: "{BRAND_CONSTANTS.LIFETIME_AMC_NOTE}"
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300">
          Digikhojindia stands behind our software quality with our signature Lifetime Free AMC initiative, strictly governed by agreed contractual terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">1. Scope of Included Maintenance Services</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">Under an active Lifetime Free AMC contract, Digikhojindia provides ongoing maintenance for the deployed software version:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-400">
          <li><strong>Defect Resolution:</strong> Prompt identification and patching of reproducible software bugs and logic defects.</li>
          <li><strong>Database Health:</strong> Scheduled database index optimization, vacuuming, and query performance tuning.</li>
          <li><strong>Security Patches:</strong> Routine vulnerability mitigation and SSL/TLS configuration maintenance.</li>
          <li><strong>Priority Support:</strong> Direct access to our support desk with defined SLA response times (4 hours for critical downtime).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">2. Explicit Contractual Exclusions</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">To prevent misunderstandings, the Lifetime Free AMC specifically <strong>DOES NOT</strong> include:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-400">
          <li><strong>New Feature Development:</strong> Requests for net-new modules, custom workflows, or redesigns outside the initial contract scope are billed separately.</li>
          <li><strong>Third-Party Costs:</strong> Recurring charges for SMS gateways (DLT), WhatsApp Business Cloud API message charges, IVR telecommunications, domain renewals, or third-party cloud hosting fees.</li>
          <li><strong>Hardware Replacement:</strong> Physical server components, network cables, routers, biometric devices, and CCTV cameras.</li>
          <li><strong>Unapproved Data Tampering:</strong> Malfunctions resulting from direct database modifications made by non-Digikhojindia personnel.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">3. Service Level Agreement (SLA) Matrix</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left border border-slate-800 mt-2">
            <thead class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-200">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-2.5 border-b border-slate-800">Priority</th>
                <th class="p-2.5 border-b border-slate-800">Initial Response SLA</th>
                <th class="p-2.5 border-b border-slate-800">Target Resolution Time</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-800">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-2.5 text-rose-400 font-semibold">Critical (System Outage)</td>
                <td class="p-2.5">Within 30 Minutes</td>
                <td class="p-2.5">4 Hours</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-2.5 text-amber-400 font-semibold">High (Degraded Feature)</td>
                <td class="p-2.5">Within 2 Hours</td>
                <td class="p-2.5">12 Hours</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-2.5 text-blue-400 font-semibold">Medium (General Query)</td>
                <td class="p-2.5">Within 4 Hours</td>
                <td class="p-2.5">24 Hours</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-2.5 text-slate-400 font-semibold">Low (Cosmetic/Enhancement)</td>
                <td class="p-2.5">Within 8 Hours</td>
                <td class="p-2.5">48 Hours</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

